      "content": "it's just hard to hear you say that. i thought maybe a scientist or a philosopher would see some kind of beauty in the struggle, or a reason to keep going even if things end. but you make it sound like the only logical thing to do is just stop halfway through. do you really think there's no value in the \"flicker\" before it goes out?",
